{% assign is_zh = false %}
{% if page.lang contains 'zh' %}{% assign is_zh = true %}{% endif %}

<section class="research-statement">
  <p class="lead">
    {% if is_zh %}
      无线系统不只是传输比特的管道，它也是连接人工智能与物理世界的重要界面。
      我的研究围绕一个核心问题展开：如何让智能模型理解无线信号的结构与物理规律，
      并进一步支持感知、生成、定位和行动？
    {% else %}
      Wireless systems are more than pipes for moving bits: they are an interface
      between artificial intelligence and the physical world. My research asks how
      intelligent models can understand the structure and physics of radio signals,
      then use them to generate, perceive, localize, and act.
    {% endif %}
  </p>
  <div class="statement-principles">
    <div><strong>{% if is_zh %}物理结构{% else %}Physical structure{% endif %}</strong><span>{% if is_zh %}让模型尊重信号与传播规律{% else %}Models grounded in signals and propagation{% endif %}</span></div>
    <div><strong>{% if is_zh %}跨域泛化{% else %}Generalization{% endif %}</strong><span>{% if is_zh %}跨环境、跨设备与跨模态工作{% else %}Across environments, devices, and modalities{% endif %}</span></div>
    <div><strong>{% if is_zh %}系统闭环{% else %}Systems impact{% endif %}</strong><span>{% if is_zh %}从方法走向真实系统与开放资源{% else %}From methods to systems and open artifacts{% endif %}</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="research-details">
  {% for area in site.data.research %}
    <section class="research-detail" id="{{ area.id }}">
      <div class="research-detail-aside">
        <div class="detail-number">{{ area.number }}</div>
        <div class="detail-short">{% if is_zh %}{{ area.short_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.short_en }}{% endif %}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="research-detail-main">
        <h2>{% if is_zh %}{{ area.title_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.title_en }}{% endif %}</h2>
        <p class="detail-tagline">{% if is_zh %}{{ area.tagline_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.tagline_en }}{% endif %}</p>
        <p>{% if is_zh %}{{ area.description_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.description_en }}{% endif %}</p>
        <div class="keyword-list">
          {% for keyword in area.keywords %}<span>{{ keyword }}</span>{% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="representative-line">
          <strong>{% if is_zh %}代表工作{% else %}Representative work{% endif %}</strong>
          <span>{% if is_zh %}{{ area.representative_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.representative_en }}{% endif %}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<section class="future-agenda">
  <div class="section-kicker">{% if is_zh %}未来议题{% else %}Forward agenda{% endif %}</div>
  <h2>{% if is_zh %}让无线智能成为真实世界 AI 的基础能力{% else %}Making wireless intelligence a foundation for real-world AI{% endif %}</h2>
  <p>
    {% if is_zh %}
      下一阶段，我希望进一步探索射频基础模型、多模态空间表征，以及通信、感知与行动之间的协同设计，
      形成从无线数据生成到具身空间理解的连续研究链条。
    {% else %}
      My forward agenda connects RF foundation models, multimodal spatial representations,
      and the co-design of communication, sensing, and action—from wireless data generation
      to embodied understanding of physical environments.
    {% endif %}
  </p>
</section>

